Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:02.07,S,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1480)}Quest'anno niente\Nbuoni propositi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.09,0:00:03.33,S,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1480)}Ti propongo il contrario:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.35,0:00:05.57,S,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1480)}una lista di cose\Nda disimparare.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.87,0:00:09.87,S,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1264)}Disimparare a dire dai, andiamo, a chi\Nsi è fermato a guardare una lumaca.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:13.70,S,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1264)}Disimparare a trattenere le\Nlacrime, come se fossero una colpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.99,0:00:16.62,S,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1261)}Disimparare a conservare le\Nferite in uno schedario,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.64,0:00:18.47,S,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1261)}ordinate per data\Ne per gravità.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.83,0:00:22.35,S,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1263)}Disimparare i sì che la bocca\Ndice mentre lo stomaco dice no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:24.52,S,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1395)}Non serve imparare\Nniente di nuovo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:26.66,S,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1395)}Basta riprenderci quello\Nche sapevamo fare.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.68,0:00:27.48,S,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1395)}Buon anno.
